    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Sullivan County is a county located in the U.S. state of New Hampshire. As of the 2010 census, the population was 43,742, making it the second-least populous county in New Hampshire. Its county seat is Newport.",
